    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/16f8a1d94387a9b3aebfb8b17a73172f.poster.avif?t=1755694599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/16f8a1d94387a9b3aebfb8b17a73172f.webm?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/16f8a1d94387a9b3aebfb8b17a73172f.mp4?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Resourcer is a survival and exploration journet set in a hostile universe. Choose your allies wisely. <br>An ancient awakening shattered your ship, leaving your systems in ruins and cutting off your only connection to your droid. Now, in the merciless world, you have to survive, adapt, and uncover the secret hidden within the ruins of this cosmic catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/d17f68cd7f46ec49a7ff24ec4a4a7961.poster.avif?t=1755694599\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/d17f68cd7f46ec49a7ff24ec4a4a7961.webm?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/d17f68cd7f46ec49a7ff24ec4a4a7961.mp4?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Gather. Build. Automate.</strong><br>Find the resources, set your generators, unleash your robots. Craft a self-sustaining network that works without you. The key to eternal survival lies in your design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/0112949b9e1a25724cebe53ae294c2f4.poster.avif?t=1755694599\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/0112949b9e1a25724cebe53ae294c2f4.webm?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/0112949b9e1a25724cebe53ae294c2f4.mp4?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Trust it? Command it?</strong><br>In this adventure, your droid is your closest ally. Step into the action by piloting it yourself, or assign it to tackle complex missions in auto mode. The choise is yours to make.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/90912d313aff89383845d31b2983e784.poster.avif?t=1755694599\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/90912d313aff89383845d31b2983e784.webm?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/90912d313aff89383845d31b2983e784.mp4?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Explore Reactive Worlds</strong><br>Every time you play, a new world awaits \u2013 filled with distinct biomes, growing dangers and ever-changing skies. Your choices shape the land itself, from radioactive swamps to realms of bizzare lifeforms. No journey is alike\u2026 and places may reject you forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/57e6d9efc015f7ebf1f69532bb026726.poster.avif?t=1755694599\" width=690 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/57e6d9efc015f7ebf1f69532bb026726.webm?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/57e6d9efc015f7ebf1f69532bb026726.mp4?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Build to Survive. Build to Control.</strong><br>In a world that resists your every move, your base is your lifeline. Expand its reach, weave your machines into purpose-driven systems, and rise avobe simple survival. This is how you create a network of true control.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/857845511892e0bfbbf16e65e31d6be7.poster.avif?t=1755694599\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/857845511892e0bfbbf16e65e31d6be7.webm?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/857845511892e0bfbbf16e65e31d6be7.mp4?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>The Cost of Power</strong><br>A corrupted force seeps into the heart of the universe, twisting your machines beyond recognition. There\u2019s a price to pay. Will you face what\u2019s coming?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In The Last Resourcer</strong>, you will build your base, automate your resources, manage your energy, and fight for survival \u2013 all within a shifting, dangerous universe.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/16f8a1d94387a9b3aebfb8b17a73172f.poster.avif?t=1755694599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/16f8a1d94387a9b3aebfb8b17a73172f.webm?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/16f8a1d94387a9b3aebfb8b17a73172f.mp4?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Resourcer is a survival and exploration journet set in a hostile universe. Choose your allies wisely. <br>An ancient awakening shattered your ship, leaving your systems in ruins and cutting off your only connection to your droid. Now, in the merciless world, you have to survive, adapt, and uncover the secret hidden within the ruins of this cosmic catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/d17f68cd7f46ec49a7ff24ec4a4a7961.poster.avif?t=1755694599\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/d17f68cd7f46ec49a7ff24ec4a4a7961.webm?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/d17f68cd7f46ec49a7ff24ec4a4a7961.mp4?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Gather. Build. Automate.</strong><br>Find the resources, set your generators, unleash your robots. Craft a self-sustaining network that works without you. The key to eternal survival lies in your design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/0112949b9e1a25724cebe53ae294c2f4.poster.avif?t=1755694599\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/0112949b9e1a25724cebe53ae294c2f4.webm?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/0112949b9e1a25724cebe53ae294c2f4.mp4?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Trust it? Command it?</strong><br>In this adventure, your droid is your closest ally. Step into the action by piloting it yourself, or assign it to tackle complex missions in auto mode. The choise is yours to make.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/90912d313aff89383845d31b2983e784.poster.avif?t=1755694599\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/90912d313aff89383845d31b2983e784.webm?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/90912d313aff89383845d31b2983e784.mp4?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Explore Reactive Worlds</strong><br>Every time you play, a new world awaits \u2013 filled with distinct biomes, growing dangers and ever-changing skies. Your choices shape the land itself, from radioactive swamps to realms of bizzare lifeforms. No journey is alike\u2026 and places may reject you forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/57e6d9efc015f7ebf1f69532bb026726.poster.avif?t=1755694599\" width=690 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/57e6d9efc015f7ebf1f69532bb026726.webm?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/57e6d9efc015f7ebf1f69532bb026726.mp4?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Build to Survive. Build to Control.</strong><br>In a world that resists your every move, your base is your lifeline. Expand its reach, weave your machines into purpose-driven systems, and rise avobe simple survival. This is how you create a network of true control.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/857845511892e0bfbbf16e65e31d6be7.poster.avif?t=1755694599\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/857845511892e0bfbbf16e65e31d6be7.webm?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/857845511892e0bfbbf16e65e31d6be7.mp4?t=1755694599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>The Cost of Power</strong><br>A corrupted force seeps into the heart of the universe, twisting your machines beyond recognition. There\u2019s a price to pay. Will you face what\u2019s coming?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In The Last Resourcer</strong>, you will build your base, automate your resources, manage your energy, and fight for survival \u2013 all within a shifting, dangerous universe.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
